terpolation":"linear"}]},"07d812a3-e8d1-5068-a840-0a60d6685448":{"name":"frame_saw","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"4b088746-452f-548f-ae6f-6fafcbff73b9","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-10.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"8a46d3dc-4178-5626-8ac5-7dada0ddac06","time":1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"fa07d25c-0acf-548a-86a2-822725516618","time":2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-10.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"424b6849-ac3f-5a10-872e-561a9e09e1bb","time":3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"1b6181a4-3305-5e4e-a292-2782a6cc0d58","time":4,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# lumber_mill_t2\n\nLumber mill upgrade: a timber mill house on a stream, a waterwheel driving a framed up-and-down saw. The stream bed is part of the model (a water strip on the east side; the game can lay real water there).\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..70, y -0..113, z -80..80 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 69, construction_0 36, construction_33 42, construction_66 49, ruined 23 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mill house: 84 x 116 x 84 centred at x -16, z 0\n- wheel: 12 x 66 x 64 at x 46, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `lumber_mill_t2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `lumber_mill_t2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_lumber_mill_t2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 4.0 | loop | `wheel` turns once per 4 s. `frame_saw` strokes twice per wheel turn. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-16, 0, -49)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-30, 0, -60)\n"}